From 74de8cc6ebdb109fc58309891632b72dc1926986 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anatoliy Klymenko <anatoliy.klymenko@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Jul 2025 13:41:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 011/190] drm: xlnx: mmi-dc: Implement cursor

commit 4c184a4ca80f293834584de36f0809393fe501ba from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Implement CRTC cursor. Cursor implemented as an universal DRM plane.
Add transitional shadow buffer as HW native AB12 format is not supported
by the DRM framework. On top of that, all user space applications expect
cursor to be of AR24 format.

